[by:LUXURI2001]
[00:00.00]作词 : Siraparn Takviriyanan/Casey Cook/Leslie Powell/Carson Maki
[00:01.00]作曲 : Siraparn Takviriyanan
[00:14.80]When dreams feel far away 当梦想似乎遥不可及
[00:17.84]And my hope begins to fade 我的希望也开始消逝
[00:21.14]I close my eyes and see you there a million miles away 我闭上双眼，见你在千里之外
[00:27.56]Then skies begin to change 尔后天空开始了变幻
[00:30.75]And colors make their way 五光十色也纷至沓来
[00:33.79]I know it's gonna be okay, okay 我深知一切都会没事
[00:38.18]No matter how deep 无论有多深
[00:39.77]No matter how far 无论有多远
[00:41.54]You always walk me through the dark 你总是伴我走过黑暗
[00:45.37]I fall into the sky 我坠入空中
[00:48.56]And time is on our side 时间在我们这边
[00:50.98]No matter how deep 无论有多深
[00:52.59]No matter how far 无论有多远
[00:54.33]You always walk me through the dark 你总是伴我走过黑暗
[00:57.36]No matter the path 无论是什么路径
[00:58.94]I find my way back to where you are 我会找到回到你身边的路
[01:02.97]'Cause baby, you're my North Star 因为宝贝，你就是我的北极星
[01:04.79]
[01:45.94]I know it's no mistake 我清楚这也不是错误
[01:49.11]If we're here out of place 若你我不在应在之所
[01:52.55]Lost is just another name for us finding our way 迷失不过是你我找到出路的另一种说法
[01:58.54]And I'm with you for the whole ride 整趟旅途，我都与你同在
[02:02.14]Weightless under your sky 在你的天空之下全然失重
[02:04.96]And your gravity feels so right, so right 你的万有引力感觉是如此合乎我心
[02:09.39]No matter how deep 无论有多深
[02:10.97]No matter how far 无论有多远
[02:12.72]You always walk me through the dark 你总是伴我走过黑暗
[02:15.74]No matter the path 无论是什么路径
[02:17.35]I find my way back to where you are 我会找到回到你身边的路
[02:21.33]'Cause baby, you're my North Star 因为宝贝，你就是我的北极星
